    {"id":158,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[4270,0],"size":[750,900],"flags":{},"order":37,"mode":0,"title":"输出 B · Open-H3-Regenerate 2K","inputs":[{"name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":314}],"outputs":[{"name":"video","type":"VIDEO","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core"},"widgets_values":["video/OpenH3_R2V_regenerate_2K","auto","auto"]},
    {"id":116,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-670],"size":[660,540],"flags":{},"order":38,"mode":0,"title":"案例说明 · 从官方 H3 R2V 改编","inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 官方 R2V → Open-H3-Regenerate 2K\n基于 [Comfy-Org 官方模板](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/main/templates/video_minimax_h3_r2v.json)。保留官方参考图条件、模型/步数切换、草稿采样与音视频输出。\n\n1. 重启 ComfyUI，确保 CKOpenH3 节点已注册。\n2. 在两个 LoadImage 节点上传你自己的参考图；模板中的文件名是官方占位图，不随案例附送。\n3. 修改 R2V 与精炼两处提示词。\n4. 新增 LoRA 文件路径见右侧模型说明。\n\n默认 768P 草稿、4步 R2V Turbo、2560×1440 放大、3步精炼；关闭 Turbo 开关切回普通20步。\n\n输出 A 保存草稿；输出 B 保存精炼视频。两者使用同一草稿音轨。精炼的静音仅是模型条件，不会将保存的视频静音。\n\n默认5秒按官方规则对齐124帧，约5.17秒；精炼解码保留全部帧。FPS 固定24，需要改时同步 CreateVideo 和 Encode Silence。\n\n仅做了静态结构审核，未运行推理；32GB峰值与效果由实际试用确认。"]},
    {"id":117,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[720,-670],"size":[950,540],"flags":{},"order":39,"mode":0,"title":"模型链接 · 已有 H3 组件直接复用","inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 已有组件（已填写本机相对路径）\n- [REF2VA INT8 基础模型](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models/Minimax-H3/`\n- [Qwen3-VL H3 INT8 文本编码器](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [H3 视频 VAE INT8](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [H3 音频 VAE FP32](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [R2V Turbo 4步 LoRA](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors) → `models/loras/MinimaxH3/`\n- [3D Latent Upscaler](https://huggingface.co/Efficient-Large-Model/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K/resolve/main/latent_upsampler/minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_conv_v1_bf16.safetensors) → `models/latent_upscale_models/`\n\nApply Regenerate 的曲线表路径已指向本地 `Minimax-H3/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_bf16.safetensors`，只读取32KB曲线表，不再加载整份模型。此文件本机已有，不用重复下载。[该文件来源](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_bf16.safetensors)。也可改为 `auto` 或已有 `adaln_t_table.bin` 路径。\n\n其他机器导入时按自己的子目录修改加载器选项。"]},
    {"id":140,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1760,-670],"size":[680,540],"flags":{},"order":40,"mode":0,"title":"新增模型 · Refiner 与 Sharp","inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Open-H3 精炼权重\n下载后放入 `models/loras/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K/`：\n\n- [open_h3_regenerate_2k_lora.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Efficient-Large-Model/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K/resolve/main/lora/open_h3_regenerate_2k_lora.safetensors) · 约12.45GB\n- [sharp_curve_branches.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Efficient-Large-Model/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K/resolve/main/lora/sharp_curve_branches.safetensors) · 约1.24GB\n\n上述链接来自 NVIDIA download.py 指向的 [发布仓库](https://huggingface.co/Efficient-Large-Model/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K)，2026-10-28 匿名 HEAD 返回200，LFS SHA256与源码预期一致。\n\n[用户原始来源 Sensen02](https://huggingface.co/Sensen02/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K) 本次匿名访问返回401，故本案例使用可访问的发布地址；已有同哈希文件可直接复用。\n\n合并 LoRA 已包含 Refiner + Turbo + Sharp 的线性增量。因此精炼从基础模型直接分支，不经过草稿的 R2V Turbo 节点。\n\n无需下载 Diffusers base_model 整包、Fast VAE、HyperFlow。"]},
    {"id":159,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2530,-670],"size":[750,540],"flags":{},"order":41,"mode":0,"title":"可替换接口与显存参数","inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 可组合接线\n- 148/149 放大 Loader/节点可换成本地已有的 Minimax H3 3D Latent Upscaler：147 视频 LATENT → 已有放大器 → 155 latent。\n- 精炼提示词单独纯文本编码，避免携带 R2V 的图像 token 与 Picture 标签。\n- 155 可接外部 NOISE / SAMPLER / SIGMAS。未接 sampler 时用原生 Euler。\n- 156 可换成原生 VAE Decode 或 VAE Decode Tiled。\n\n默认放大采用 BF16、时间块8、overlap2，属于低显存近似设置，非 NVIDIA 整段基准。要比较整段效果可关闭时间分块。\n\n精炼后默认卸载模型，再解码2K。Sharp分支在CPU计算小型时间调制结果。\n\n此案例复用本地 REF2VA/量化组件，是接入现有流程的示例，不宣称与 NVIDIA Diffusers 原始基础模型逐位等价。\n\n仅依赖 ComfyUI 核心节点与本插件，无新增插件安装需求。"]},
    {"id":160,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[3370,-670],"size":[750,540],"flags":{},"order":42,"mode":0,"title":"来源、调参与输出","inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 来源\n- [官方 H3 R2V 工作流](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/main/templates/video_minimax_h3_r2v.json)\n- [NVIDIA 推理源码](https://github.com/NVlabs/Sana/tree/sol-engine/models/Open-H3-Regenerate-2K)\n- [放大器原项目](https://github.com/LBH-123-AI/Comfyui_Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler)\n\n尺寸可在149调整：2K=2560×1440；1080P可算1920×1088再在156裁到1920×1080。\n\n默认所有输出保留完整124帧；如要121帧参考长度，请同时处理音轨时长，不要仅在解码节点硬截短后误认为仍完全同步。\n\n输出目录：\n- `output/video/OpenH3_R2V_draft_...`\n- `output/video/OpenH3_R2V_regenerate_2K_...`\n\n保留两个输出用于对照会多一次草稿视频解码。可将草稿 SaveVideo 设为 Never，仅运行精炼输出；草稿音频解码仍用于最终音轨。\n\n模型与源码各自遵循原始许可证，详见插件 NOTICE.md。"]}
  ],
